.TH AMIVULN-CVE 1  amivuln 
.SH NAME
cve \- Is this host affected by a CVE? Scans every installed package
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcve\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICVE\-ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Is this host affected by a CVE? Scans every installed package
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICVE\-ID\fR>
CVE ids, for example CVE\-2024\-6387
